cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Fuse: Circuit breakers and a kill switch for AI agent fleets"
abstract: >-
  Fuse sets per-agent and per-fleet limits on actions, spend, resources
  touched and error rates, and when an agent trips one, revokes its
  credentials in one step and pauses the agents that depend on it.
authors:
